<!--
The Core (corona): a containment building shaped as a circular crown (a stepped futuristic torus)
with a big central hall open to the sky, above which floats the quantum sphere of black voxels
in magnetic suspension with energy cells pulsing on and off in neon blue,
a monumental entrance portal on the south front at z=0 with a clear inner hall,
the blue neon sign "IL NUCLEO" on a dark matte plate above the portal,
four anchoring pylons with structural beams and neon containment beams towards the sphere,
and a central emission well with magnetic collimation rings on the ground.
Written by Gemini CLI (Gemini 3.8 Flash, subscription) on 23/10/2026, task T19.
Box: 14 × 14 × 14 tiles, 112 × 112 × 112 voxels, 8 voxels per tile.
Key letters:
  O = door (letter O, name "porta", at the centre x=56, y=105, z=0..17, an entrance space with an empty inner through hall y=92..104)
  F = sign ("IL NUCLEO", blue neon 6fc3ff with a steady glow on the dark plate P above the portal at z=22..28, y=106..107)
  P = dark matte plate for the sign (0a0e14)
  M = primary cybernetic black metal (14141a, ring armour, slabs, pylons)
  m = dark secondary metal (20222a, casings, technical panels, equatorial bands)
  K = deep black core of the floating sphere (0a0c12)
  C = perimeter graphite concrete (34363e, raft and walkways)
  c = dark technical aggregate and asphalt (262830)
  S = light structural steel (8a8f9c, diagonal suspension beams, trusses, antennas)
  s = dark support steel (525662, profiles and grids)
  V = dark reflecting glass (182434, window bands of the torus)
  v = bluish reflections of the glass (2c425c)
  w = light reflections of the glass (486a8a)
  N = bright blue neon (6fc3ff glow, containment beams, accent frames)
  n = soft blue neon (3a8ad8 glow, collimation rings, roof guides)
  R = red obstacle warning beacons (ff3a3a glow)
  1 = active energy cell of the sphere (6fc3ff glow, bright blue)
  0 = energy cell of the sphere off (16202c, stasis)
  x = temporary buffer for the animation (hidden)
Architecture:
  - A polygonal/circular foundation raft at z=0..2 (102 voxels across, kept away from the edges of the grid).
  - A circular torus in three concentric orders stepping down from z=0 to z=34 (outer diameter 96, inner hole 44 voxels).
  - A central collimation well (x=56, y=56, z=0..8) open to the sky with a stepped magnetic field projector.
  - A black quantum sphere K (40 voxels across, z=56..95) hanging in the void at the centre of the court at z~7-12 tiles.
  - 4 corner anchoring pylons (z=28..38) with structural beams S and containment rays N/n connected to the sphere.
  - A monumental access portal to the south (x=46..66, y=100..107, z=0..22) with door O and an empty inner hall (y=92..104).
  - The sign "IL NUCLEO" in blue neon letters F centred at x=56, y=107, z=23..27.
Animation "pulsa" (8 frames):
  A periodic swap of the active (1, glow) and inactive (0) energy cells on the surface of the quantum sphere.
-->
